<Slide>
  <Box style={{width: '100%', height: '100%', paddingTop: 32, paddingBottom: 20, paddingLeft: 64, paddingRight: 64}}>
    {/* A · Title */}
    <Box style={{height: 88, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 12}}>
      <Box style={{width: 4, height: 40, background: '#0072BC', marginTop: 4}} />
      <Box style={{flex: 1}}>
        <Text style={{fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 700, color: '#0F2C4D', lineHeight: 1.3}}>所有看板，一屏可达</Text>
        <Text style={{fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 400, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 6}}>
          目录本身就是产品：找到正确的看板不再是一场记忆考试。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* B · Content : image left 56% */}
    <Box style={{height: 516, marginTop: 12, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32}}>
      <Box style={{width: 620, height: '100%', borderRadius: 10, overflow: 'hidden', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0'}}>
        <Image src="assets/portal_screen.png" style={{width: '100%', height: '100%', objectFit: 'cover'}} />
      </Box>

      <Box style={{flex: 1, height: '100%', justifyContent: 'space-between'}}>
        <Box>
          <Text style={{fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 700, color: '#0F2C4D'}}>一份目录，十个业务域</Text>
          <Text style={{fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 400, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 8, lineHeight: 1.55}}>
            五十六张看板与报表，按贵司实际的组织方式来分组：MS 综合运维、告警与工单、
            网络性能、传输承载、动力与备件、自动化调度等等。
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box>
          <Text style={{fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 700, color: '#0F2C4D'}}>四种看法</Text>
          <Text style={{fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 400, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 8, lineHeight: 1.55}}>
            卡片网格用来浏览、高密清单用来检索、业务域矩阵给管理层俯瞰、
            任务视图显示平台此刻正在跑什么。
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box>
          <Text style={{fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 700, color: '#0F2C4D'}}>值班室和会议室都能用</Text>
          <Text style={{fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 400, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 8, lineHeight: 1.55}}>
            中英文一键切换，深浅两套主题适配现场光线；任意看板可扫码在手机上打开，
            也可以就地内嵌预览。
          </Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{background: '#0F2C4D', borderRadius: 10, padding: 18, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center'}}>
          <Box>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 900, color: '#FFFFFF'}}>56</Text>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.65)'}}>张看板</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 900, color: '#FFFFFF'}}>10</Text>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.65)'}}>个业务域</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 900, color: '#FFFFFF'}}>4</Text>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.65)'}}>种视图</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 30, fontWeight: 900, color: '#FF922B'}}>2</Text>
            <Text style={{fontSize: 12, color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.65)'}}>种语言</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    {/* C · Footer */}
    <Box style={{height: 40, marginTop: 12, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E2E8F0'}}>
      <Text style={{fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8'}}>OLR MS 运维工具平台</Text>
      <Text style={{fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8'}}>08 / 17</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
</Slide>
